+## 5. Resolved Questions
+- **Permission Granularity:** Custom roles will be composed of granular permissions (e.g., `action:device_register`, `action:audit_read`) matching the existing ActionRegistry vocabulary.
+- **Hierarchy:** Custom roles will NOT support hierarchy/inheritance to keep evaluation flat and predictable.
 
 ## 6. Alignment with AGENTS.md
-- **Safe Evaluation:** `UNKNOWN` states or evaluation failures must safely fail-closed (DENIED / AUTHZ_NOT_EVALUATED), maintaining the existing `RbacEvaluator` guarantees.
+- **Safe Evaluation:** Unresolvable states or evaluation failures must safely fail-closed (DENIED / AUTHZ_NOT_EVALUATED), maintaining the existing `RbacEvaluator` guarantees.
